# data/ is written directly by the Cloudflare Worker (and by players' own
# mod uploads) via GitHub's API — it changes constantly from live usage.
# Never commit it from a local clone: a locally-pulled snapshot is stale the
# moment someone else uploads, and committing it back would clobber real
# listings/reports/FAQ entries other people have added since you last pulled.
# Already-tracked files in here are also marked --skip-worktree locally so
# local changes to them never show up in `git status` either.
data/
